<title>USA: CCAIR May load factor rises slightly.</title>
<headline>CCAIR May load factor rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CCAIR Inc said on Friday that its May load factor increased to 52.5 percent from 51.9 percent in May 1996.</p>
<p>Revenue passenger miles in May fell to 13.3 million from 14.3 million in May 1996, May's available seat miles decreased 8.0 percent to 25.4 million from 27.6 million in the year ago period, CCAIR said.</p>
<p>In the year to date period, CCAIR's load factor increased to 47.5 percent from 47.4 percent, the company said.</p>
